ruckus(config-wlan)# max-clients 513
The Max. client value must be a number between 1 and 512.
ruckus(config-wlan)# rate-limit perssid_uplink 501
The rate of limiting must be between 0.1 and 500.0 mbps. 0 means disable.  020 or 020.0 is error format. 
ruckus(config-wlan)# rate-limit uplink 5
The command is either unrecognized or incomplete. To view a list of commands that you can run  from this context, type '?' or 'help'.
